# Supabase Postgres connection (drive-from-castellanos project, us-east-2).
# Get the real values from Supabase project settings -> Database -> Connection string.
# Use the *pooled* (transaction mode, port 6543) host for scripts, the direct (5432)
# host if you ever need a long-lived session (e.g. an interactive psql session).
